<http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/np1/assertion> {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-infinitesimal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/Claim> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-infinitesimal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fisher's infinitesimal model of quantitative inheritance" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-infinitesimal> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Continuous traits determined by many Mendelian loci of small additive effect produce the observed correlations between relatives, so biometric and Mendelian inheritance are consistent." .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-infinitesimal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/TestableHypothesis> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-infinitesimal> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "Cov(z_i, z_j) = 2\\Theta_{ij} V_A + \\Delta_{ij} V_D; in the limit of M \\to \\infty loci the offspring trait given parents is Gaussian with mean (z_1+z_2)/2 and segregation variance V_0(1-\\bar{F}), with error O(1/\\sqrt{M}) (Barton, Etheridge and Veber 2017)" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-infinitesimal> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/context> "Assumptions: many unlinked loci of small additive effect, random mating, environmental effects independent of genotype. Formal status: the covariance decomposition is proved; the infinitesimal limit, including under selection, is proved by Barton, Etheridge and Veber (2017). Large-effect loci and epistasis break the Gaussian limit." .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-infinitesimal> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/proposedTest> "Compare observed correlations between relatives of different degree in large pedigrees with 2*Theta*V_A + Delta*V_D, and check that the within-family segregation variance stays near V_0(1-F) under selection, as the limit theorem predicts." .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-infinitesimal> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hypothesisType> "model-theorem" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-infinitesimal> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "Ronald A. Fisher (1919) The Correlation between Relatives on the Supposition of Mendelian Inheritance" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-infinitesimal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.tpb.2017.06.001> .
}
